<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on March 5.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on March 5.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				 March 5		March 4</p>
<p>Fed acct			 5.239		  5.927</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	   9.913		 13.173</p>
<p>Cash balance		  15.152		 19.100</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt, </p>
<p>subject to limit	5,273.184	     5,277.137</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $2 million were issued and $58 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
